{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-janu-dubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"janu-dubai-hh-development-difc","about":"Janu Dubai at DIFC is an iconic new development by Aman Group and H&amp;H Development, designed to bring a refined sense of modern luxury to the heart of the Dubai International Financial Centre. Set within a striking 40-storey tower, the project will feature a harmonious mix of 150 meticulously designed hotel rooms, branded residences, and an exclusive members’ club. Developed by H&amp;H through its subsidiary Alia Developments, and brought to life by world-renowned architects Herzog &amp; de Meuron, H&amp;H Janu Dubai at DIFC promises an architectural statement unlike any other in Dubai.Residents and guests will enjoy expansive outdoor terraces, private balconies, and thoughtfully integrated green spaces that elevate the living experience. With its strategic Janu Dubai location in DIFC, the development ensures effortless access to fine dining, retail outlets, and cultural attractions. Future homeowners can take advantage of a flexible payment plan of Janu Dubai by H&amp;H, making it a compelling choice for investors and lifestyle buyers alike. Blending sophisticated design with the holistic living philosophy of Aman, Janu Dubai amenities are set to redefine luxury living in the heart of Dubai.","price":18000000,"title":"Janu Dubai","bitrix":{"id":1168,"pf_id":"are.2.14366","source":null,"project_id":"Janu Dubai","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Janu Dubai","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"H&H Development","project_location":"DIFC"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Janu_Dubai_at_Dubai_International_Financial_Centre_4b0cc9856c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Janu_Dubai_at_Dubai_International_Financial_Centre_4b0cc9856c.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2096849